From: Sid Jain <sid_26@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] v8: retain C handles and preserve borrowed call values

Give Stores ownership of C wrappers borrowed by Rust aliases. Release temporary
types and traps while their isolate is live, and copy borrowed call values and
imports before passing them to owning C API vectors.

The complete ordered series is the build and qualification unit.

